    "description": "The List Car Rental Reservation Returns API provides a detailed view of customer reservations that have been returned. This endpoint allows businesses to efficiently track and manage the status of vehicle returns after rentals. Typical consumers include car rental companies and fleet management systems, which utilize the data for operational insights and reporting. By accessing this API, users can streamline their return processes, improve inventory management, and enhance customer service. It serves as a critical resource for maintaining accurate records of returned vehicles.",
